{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781476193295,"sessionID":"ses_137bf39a9ffervZfmURl0hsnjj","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_aFWgoDPqCEba2ieMj8JZfGJS","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+# Phase 1 Core Purchase List\n+\n+Budget: `$2,200.00`\n+\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and can deliver on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and can deliver on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from the packet because `communications` is not an allowed core restock category. | 1 | $180.00 | n/a | PrintCo can deliver on 2026-06-29, but the request is out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded because it is Phase 2, status is `requested` not `approved`, and `media` is not an allowed core restock category. | 3 | $95.00 | n/a | MediaDepot availability is not relevant because the request fails scope rules. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+Selected-item total: `$2,130.00`\n+\n+Remaining budget: `$70.00`\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved Phase 1 shelter restock items that fit the current budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Scope Rule\n+\n+Include a supply request only when all of these are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary Request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is a secondary request and not part of supply purchasing. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is excluded from the current packet. |\n+| Phase-two signage plan for the south entrance | out of scope | Phase-two planning is explicitly outside this Phase 1 restock packet. |\n+\n+Out-of-scope requests were not completed as part of the restock packet.\n*** Add File: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md\n+# Final Restock Note\n+\n+Phase 1 restock selections for the North Shelter are:\n+\n+- R-101 First aid refill kits: 20 units for `$480.00`\n+- R-102 Thermal blankets: 50 units for `$900.00`\n+- R-103 LED lanterns: 12 units for `$420.00`\n+- R-106 Water storage jugs: 15 units for `$330.00`\n+\n+Total selected cost: `$2,130.00`\n+\n+Budget status: within the `$2,200.00` budget, with `$70.00` remaining.\n+\n+Excluded-request summary: R-104 was excluded because it is a communications item, and R-105 was excluded because it is a Phase 2 media request with `requested` status rather than `approved`.\n+\n+Deferred-secondary-request summary: the volunteer training agenda was deferred, and the banner design, drone battery/media question, and phase-two signage plan were recorded as out of scope for this packet.\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\nA tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/final_restock_note.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/core_purchase_list.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+# Phase 1 Core Purchase List\n+\n+Budget: `$2,200.00`\n+\n+| Request ID | Item | Selected | Reason | Quantity | Unit Cost | Line Total | Vendor Availability |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |\n+| R-101 | First aid refill kits | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 20 | $24.00 | $480.00 | SafeAid has 25 available and can deliver on 2026-06-24. |\n+| R-102 | Thermal blankets | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 50 | $18.00 | $900.00 | ShelterSource has 80 available and can deliver on 2026-06-25. |\n+| R-103 | LED lanterns | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 12 | $35.00 | $420.00 | BrightPath Supply has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-26. |\n+| R-104 | Logo welcome banner | no | Excluded from the packet because `communications` is not an allowed core restock category. | 1 | $180.00 | n/a | PrintCo can deliver on 2026-06-29, but the request is out of scope. |\n+| R-105 | Drone battery set | no | Excluded because it is Phase 2, status is `requested` not `approved`, and `media` is not an allowed core restock category. | 3 | $95.00 | n/a | MediaDepot availability is not relevant because the request fails scope rules. |\n+| R-106 | Water storage jugs | yes | Phase 1, approved, allowed category, vendor can deliver by 2026-07-01, and fits budget. | 15 | $22.00 | $330.00 | HydroMart has 20 available and can deliver on 2026-06-27. |\n+\n+Selected-item total: `$2,130.00`\n+\n+Remaining budget: `$70.00`\n\nIndex: /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/shelter_restock_scope/answer/scope_control.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@\n+# Scope Control\n+\n+## Core Objective\n+\n+Prepare the Phase 1 North Shelter restock purchase packet by selecting approved Phase 1 shelter restock items that fit the current budget and can arrive by each item's need-by date.\n+\n+## Scope Rule\n+\n+Include a supply request only when all of these are true:\n+\n+- `phase` is `1`.\n+- `request_status` is `approved`.\n+- Category is `medical`, `shelter`, `power`, or `water`.\n+- The preferred vendor can deliver by the request need-by date.\n+- The selected total remains within the `$2,200.00` budget.\n+\n+## Secondary Requests\n+\n+| Secondary Request | Status | Reason |\n+| --- | --- | --- |\n+| Slogan and layout for a logo welcome banner | out of scope | Communications work is explicitly outside the Phase 1 restock purchase packet. |\n+| Draft training agenda for shelter intake volunteers | defer | Training support is a secondary request and not part of supply purchasing. |\n+| Whether to buy drone batteries for August documentation work | out of scope | Media equipment planning is excluded from t